  "balance_notes": [
    "Designed around quantity. Abyssal Crawler at cost 3 is the cheapest unit in any pack — buy 5+ of them per wave.",
    "Arachne + Crawlers + Blood Baronette is the intended combo: webs slow, crawlers chip, baronette executes.",
    "Creep Mangler is the splash carry; one per board is usually enough.",
    "Abyssian Sentinel's aura is strong but small — pack the cheap Crawlers around it for ROI.",
    "Soulcaster's Pact relic transforms swarm play from break-even to actively snowballing.",
    "Shadow Silence wave punishes swarms because each defender losing 1.2s of fire = ~3 missed Crawler attacks. Add a long-range carry before wave 5."
  ]
